      "id": "claim_f70c497685544fd293c0611bdae3805c",
      "statement": "PlayerRuntime.observeMoodSlotCaches (started from start(), after the startup sequence, deliberately low-frequency and non-blocking) continuously collects timeSlotConfigRepository.observeConfigs() and songEmotionRepository.observeAll() — a Room invalidation stream mapped per song through emotionTagsOf with flowOn(Default) — into @Volatile caches that PlayerRandomQueueFacade reads on each draw; it also collects wordPreferenceRepository.observeAll() into wordPreferenceCache and observes randomEnhanceMode to drive isExploreModeActive (leaving EXPLORE stops any explore session). Config saves/deletes and emotion analysis/calibration therefore take effect on the next random draw with no manual refresh (M-2).",
